  "text": " \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Linn County Elections - Election Lookup Tool \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n Find your Polling Place, Sample Ballots, Election Districts & Elected Officials \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n Step 1 of 3\n \n Enter your house number, then click search.\n \n Addresses matching your search will appear in Step 2. \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n House # ONLY \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n Tools From Secretary of State:\n \n \n Am I Registered to Vote?\n \n \n Track Your Absentee Ballot\n \n \n \n \n Links:\n \n Early Voting Calendar (Satellite & Office Absentee)\n \n Linn County Elections\n \n Linn County Auditor\n \n Secretary of State\n \n \n \n \n \n \nNeed help? Email your address to elections@linnCountyIowa.gov or call 319-892-5300 ext 1.\n \n \n\n \nLinn County makes no warranties, expressed or implied, including without limitation, any warranties of merchantability \nor fitness to a particular purpose. In no event shall Linn County be liable for lost profits or any consequential or \nincidental damages cause by the use of this website.\n \n\n \nLinn County does not guarantee the accuracy of the locations as mapped by Google Maps. \n\n \nBuilt by Code|Works Software Factory, Inc. \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n"
